OL,3,GNEWSAAncient tree cutting given as a
OL,4,Agift to arboretum
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sapling propagated from one of the
OL,7,Fcountry's largest and oldest London
OL,8,Fplane trees has been given as a gift to
OL,9,Fan arboretum.
OL,11,FThe Ely London plane tree was thought
OL,12,Fto have been given by Charles II to the
OL,13,FBishop of Ely in the 1670s for his
OL,14,Fpalace garden, which is now part of
OL,15,FKing's private school in the
OL,16,FCambridgeshire cathedral city.
OL,18,FA young tree grown from it has now been
OL,19,Fplanted at Forestry England's Lynford
OL,20,FArboretum, near Mundford, in Norfolk.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
