OL,3,GNEWSAAncient tree cutting given as a
OL,4,Agift to arboretum
OL,5,
OL,6,FDan Luscombe, curator for Forestry
OL,7,FEngland, said: "Planting this young
OL,8,Ftree means the public will have the
OL,9,Fopportunity to enjoy a remarkable piece
OL,10,Fof East Anglian heritage as it grows
OL,11,Ffor generations to come."
